UID:adebc13dab94bf63313bba9729be6212@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,reading
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Community\\n\\nThis series is designed to provide helpful
 \, research-based tips and strategies for coping with the impacts of a pro
 state cancer diagnosis. Feature presentations on topics such as exercise\,
  nutrition\, emotional support. Patients and caregivers are invited to joi
