 ing\, painting\, and drawing and infuse the work with tangible textiles. E
 ach artist's unique personal narrative of choice will be visually translat
 ed into a textured comic in the format of a haptic zine (self-published bo
 oklet). All supplies will be provided for participants\, although artists 
 are invited to bring a\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com
