DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Included with admissi
 on\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: Arts & Crafts\\n\\nThe Field Museum is pro
 ud to showcase new sculptures from the collection by Oaxacan artist Aveli
 no Pérez. These beautifully carved and painted figures were created in c
 ollaboration with the bilingual children's book author\, Cynthia Weill\, 
 for her latest publication ¡Tocamos! View our newest acquisitions from O
 axaca and learn about the Field Museum’s longstanding partnership with 
 author Cynthia Weill. Presented by Emma Turner-Trujillo\, Assistant Regist
 rar\, Anthropology Collections.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.or
 g/our-events/meet-a-scientist/tocamos-oaxacan-folk-art-by-avelino-perez
